{"4263410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noggin", "steam_appid": 4263410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noggin is a 3-5 Player Challenging Co-operative Action Game. Gather bizarre heads with unique playstyles, weapons with powerful abilities, and rhythm-game dances that grant game-changing buffs. Collaborate with your teammates to overcome demanding boss fights in this gauntlet-style trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/5b382176f9b58094b7a91464ca252d88.avif?t=1781364523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras_big/5b382176f9b58094b7a91464ca252d88.avif?t=1781364523 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FLAWLESS CO-OPERATION SKILLS?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players MUST learn to co-operate flawlessly with one-another. Actions in Noggin are fundamentally Co-Op first. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to dodge an attack? Can't do that alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to deal big damage? You'll need support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to complete the Nine, beat , and earn the bragging rights of the century?! Better hope your mates are LOCKED IN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/5e78276ad0a7313d5939708481172c4d.avif?t=1781364523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras_big/5e78276ad0a7313d5939708481172c4d.webp?t=1781364523 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ALONE YOU ARE JUST A MAN... UNITED YOU BECOME SOMETHING GREATER</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noggin isn't a game to play before bed while you chat about your ex. You won't be cruising through fields of mindless zombies, or listening to a moody priest reel off the problems faced by the people of this fair land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noggin instead plays as a series of ARPG-Style Boss-Fights. Determine the challenge your group can face. Make preperations before each fight. Then team up to fight truly horrific beings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such as: A salmon! DAD-man? ... A baby?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/a1ad976638ecd22e0c901d201a03f3bd.poster.avif?t=1781364523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/a1ad976638ecd22e0c901d201a03f3bd.webm?t=1781364523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/a1ad976638ecd22e0c901d201a03f3bd.mp4?t=1781364523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the Rawbs together. Alone, Rawb is nothing. United, Rawb can become something greater. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noggin is a 3-5 Player Challenging Co-operative Action Game. Gather bizarre heads with unique playstyles, weapons with powerful abilities, and rhythm-game dances that grant game-changing buffs. Collaborate with your teammates to overcome demanding boss fights in this gauntlet-style trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4263410/extras/5b382176f9b58094b7a91464ca252